#### POST /api/v1/records — 创建记录

**请求体**：

```json
{
  "shop_id": "shop_uuid 或 null",
  "shop_name": "Manner Coffee · 静安寺店",
  "shop_brand": "Manner",
  "coffee_category": "latte",
  "bean_origin": "埃塞俄比亚 耶加雪菲",
  "roast_level": "medium_light",
