#### POST /api/v1/cards/match — 匹配/生成卡片

**功能**：优先查询预生成库匹配，命中直接返回；未命中触发实时生成。

**请求体**：

```json
{
  "record_id": "record_uuid",
  "brand": "Manner",
  "coffee_category": "latte"
}
```

**响应体（预生成命中）**：

```json
{
  "code": 0,
  "data": {
    "card_source": "pre_generated",
    "card_image_url": "https://oss.xxx/cards/manner_latte.png",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://oss.xxx/cards/manner_latte_thumb.jpg"
  }
}
```

**响应体（触发实时生成）**：

```json
{
  "code": 0,
  "data": {
    "card_source": "realtime",
    "task_id": "task_uuid",
    "status": "generating",
    "estimated_time": 5
  }
}
```

---

#### GET /api/v1/cards/{record_id}/status — 查询卡片生成状态

**响应体**：

```json
{
  "code": 0,
  "data": {
    "status": "generated",
    "card_source": "realtime",
    "card_image_url": "https://oss.xxx/cards/xxx.png"
  }
}
```

**轮询策略**：仅实时生成场景需要轮询，前端每 2 秒轮询一次，超时 30 秒后提示「生成超时」。预生成命中无需轮询。

