## 七、埋点设计

### 7.1 关键事件埋点

| 事件名 | 触发时机 | 关键参数 |
|--------|----------|----------|
| app_launch | App 启动 | launch_source, is_first_launch |
| click_record | 点击记录按钮 | entry_type(float_button/home_card) |
| start_photo_record | 开始拍照记录 | - |
| start_manual_record | 开始手动记录 | - |
| photo_taken | 拍照完成 | - |
| ai_recognize_result | AI 识别返回 | category, confidence, is_correct |
| submit_record | 提交记录 | has_photo, has_bean_info, duration |
| card_match_start | 卡片匹配开始 | brand, coffee_category |
| card_match_hit | 预生成库命中 | brand, coffee_category, duration |
| card_generate_start | 实时生成开始 | brand, coffee_category |
| card_generate_success | 卡片生成成功 | card_source(pre_generated/realtime), duration, retry_count |
| card_generate_fail | 卡片生成失败 | error_type |
| card_regenerate | 重新生成卡片 | card_source |
| card_save | 保存卡片 | also_save_to_album |
| card_share | 分享卡片 | platform |
| view_card_detail | 查看卡片详情 | record_id |
| delete_record | 删除记录 | - |
| edit_record | 编辑记录 | - |
| view_stats | 查看统计页 | - |
| search_shop | 搜索店铺 | keyword |
| select_shop | 选择店铺 | shop_source(search/nearby/custom) |
| login | 登录 | method(wechat/phone/apple) |
| register | 注册 | method |

### 7.2 漏斗定义

**记录漏斗**：

```
click_record → start_record → submit_record → card_generate_success → card_save
```

**分享漏斗**：

```
card_generate_success → card_share → share_success
```

